Subject: [PATCH 448/488] [DS4.1] DSpark's eager context step joins and stores
 in TileLang

The drafter's model joins the target's auxiliary hidden states side by
side in one TileLang launch and its norm writes the combined rows into
the speculator's context buffer: torch's cat and the copy after the
combine gone.
